        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=9d0bf7e5c07194485c7f81827005599ecced9712&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update the <code class=\"notranslate\">mdn-urls</code> linter, ignoring overview pages (with <code class=\"notranslate\">browser-compat</code> front matter).</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ensures that reference pages with the same <code class=\"notranslate\">browser-compat</code> front matter get added to BCD.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #29339.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4134789075\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29339\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29339/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29339\">#29339</a>.</p>",
